description:
•	Enlargement of the front lightwell and replacement of the lower ground floor window;
•	Demolition of the rear bay window and balcony, and erection of a single-storey rear extension with basement below;
•	Rebuilding of the external stair from the ground floor to rear garden;
•	Removal of non-original windows and reinstatement of traditional window designs in line with the building’s original Edwardian detailing.
